WEBVTT

00:08:56.829 --> 00:09:00.012
How could Sierra Leone participate
in the digital economy

00:09:00.036 --> 00:09:02.519
and become an innovation hub?

00:09:03.752 --> 00:09:04.903
Guess what?

00:09:04.927 --> 00:09:07.978
He left his cozy job at IBM,

00:09:08.002 --> 00:09:11.251
and he now leads a team
of young men and women

00:09:11.275 --> 00:09:16.709
within the newly established Directorate
of Science, Technology and Innovation

00:09:16.733 --> 00:09:18.114
in my own office.

00:09:18.974 --> 00:09:22.412
(Applause)

00:09:23.674 --> 00:09:25.554
That young man is right in here.

00:09:26.225 --> 00:09:29.551
I challenged another
young Sierra Leonean woman

00:09:29.575 --> 00:09:34.034
to set up and lead the new Ministry
of Planning and Economic Development.